<!DOCTYPE html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="UTF-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>Route & coach planner | TrackEase</title><jsp:include page="../WEB-INF/ui/head.jsp" /></head><body><jsp:include page="../navbar.jsp" /><main id="main-content" class="shell"><div class="page-intro"><span class="eyebrow">TrackEase / Route & coach planner</span><h1>Route & coach planner</h1></div><div data-feature-message role="alert" hidden></div><section class="panel"><p>Configure a future journey before any bookings or holds exist. This enables intermediate-stop search, class fares, seat maps, holds, and RAC. Existing booked journeys keep their original allocation mode.</p><form data-route-planner><div class="field"><label class="form-label" for="plannerJourney">Journey</label><select id="plannerJourney" class="form-select" required></select></div><div data-planner-preview class="info-banner mb-4"></div><h2>Intermediate stops</h2><p class="field-help">First and last stops are taken from the journey. Add intermediate stops in travel order; provide arrival/departure times and cumulative base fare from the origin.</p><div data-stop-rows></div><button class="button secondary small mb-4" type="button" data-add-stop>Add intermediate stop</button><div class="field"><label class="form-label" for="routeFare">Whole-route base fare</label><input id="routeFare" class="form-control" type="number" min="0.01" step="0.01" required></div><h2>Coaches &amp; classes</h2><p class="field-help">Each coach holds up to 80 seats. A class has one multiplier applied to the segment fare difference. Each reserved RAC berth offers two shared places. Use zero RAC berths for standard seating.</p><div data-coach-rows></div><button class="button secondary small mb-4" type="button" data-add-coach>Add coach</button><div><button class="button" type="submit">Save route &amp; coach plan</button></div></form></section></main><jsp:include page="../WEB-INF/ui/footer.jsp" /></body></html>